"abstract":[{"text":"The wedge type represents crescendo and diminuendo wedge symbols. The type attribute is crescendo for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"start of a wedge that is closed at the left side, and diminuendo for the start of a wedge that is closed on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the right side. Spread values are measured in tenths; those at the start of a crescendo wedge or end of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"diminuendo wedge are ignored. The niente attribute is yes if a circle appears at the point of the wedge,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"indicating a crescendo from nothing or diminuendo to nothing. It is no by default, and used only when the type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is crescendo, or the type is stop for a wedge that began with a diminuendo type. The line-type is solid if not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specified.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLWedge"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLWedge/isNiente":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlwedge\/isniente","title":"isNiente","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isNiente","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A Boolean value indicating whether a circle appears at the point of the wedge, indicating a crescendo from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"nothing or diminuendo to nothing."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLWedge\/isNiente"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","kind":"sy